 "remarks": "Set on a quiet street in the desirable Cranbury neighborhood, this beautifully maintained 4-bedroom, 3 full bath home offers a wonderful blend of comfort, updates, and flexible living space. The main level features hardwood floors, a welcoming living room, dining room with fireplace, and a spacious kitchen with granite countertops, stainless steel appliances, and abundant cabinetry. The home is filled with natural light and includes updated bathrooms and a partially finished lower level ideal for a family room, home office, gym, recreation area, or guests. The lower level walks out to a large patio and private in-ground pool featuring new marble coping, a newer pool pump motor, and pool heater. Major improvements include a new roof, high-efficiency heating and cooling systems, conversion from oil to propane, updated mechanicals, enhanced air filtration, new hot water system, and smart thermostat. Conveniently located near shopping, restaurants, parks, golf, Route 7, and the Merritt Parkway, this Cranbury home offers plenty of space to enjoy both indoors and out.",
